# ================= KUET WasteX =================
# C++ console app (main.cpp + headers) with a Node web dashboard in webui/.
# No npm: the dashboard runs on Node's built-in http/fs only.

# ---------------- C++ build output ----------------
KUETWasteX.exe
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
*.gch
*.out
a.out
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.dll
*.stackdump
build/
dist/

# ---------------- Web dashboard ----------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.env
.env.local

# ---------------- Runtime state (recreated by the app) ----------------
# Truck position written when a simulated position is set on the map.
# The app falls back to the logical campus node when this file is absent.
webui/mapdata/driver_position.json
# Accounts created through "Create an account" on the login page.
webui/user_profiles.json

# ---------------- Editor / OS junk ----------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------- Local scratch ----------------
*.tmp
*.log

# Kept on purpose (do not ignore):
#   wastex_data.txt              demo dataset the app starts from
#   webui/mapdata/*.json|geojson campus map data + initial manual_coords.json ({})
#   WasteX_Report_Screenshots/   report figures
#   *.bat, Makefile, *.pdf, *.docx, *.png, *.jpg, *.svg
